PewterCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderBrock2Intro::
	.string "BROCK: Wow, it’s not often that we\n"
	.string "get a challenger from JOHTO.\p"
	.string "I’m BROCK, the PEWTER GYM LEADER.\n"
	.string "I’m an expert on rock-type POKéMON.\p"
	.string "My POKéMON are impervious to most\n"
	.string "physical attacks.\p"
	.string "You’ll have a hard time inflicting\n"
	.string "any damage.\p"
	.string "Come on!$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderBrock2Defeat::
	.string "BROCK: Your POKéMON’s powerful\n"
	.string "attacks overcame my rock-hard\l"
	.string "defense...\p"
	.string "You’re stronger than I expected...\n"
	.string "Go ahead--take this BADGE.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the BOULDERBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderBrock2_1::
	.string "BROCK: The world is huge.\n"
	.string "There are still many strong\l"
	.string "trainers like you.\p"
	.string "Just wait and see. I’m going to\n"
	.string "become a lot stronger too.$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderBrock2_2::
	.string "BROCK: {PLAYER}, thanks.\n"
	.string "I enjoyed battling you, even\l"
	.string "though I am a bit upset.\p"
	.string "That BOULDERBADGE will make your\n"
	.string "POKéMON even more powerful.$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_CamperJerryIntro::
	.string "The trainers of this GYM use\n"
	.string "rock-type POKéMON.\p"
	.string "The rock-type has high DEFENSE.\p"
	.string "Battles could end up going a long\n"
	.string "time.\p"
	.string "Are you ready for this?$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_CamperJerryDefeat::
	.string "I have to win these battles...$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_CamperJerry::
	.string "Hey, you! Trainer from JOHTO!\n"
	.string "BROCK is tough.\p"
	.string "He’ll punish you if you don’t take\n"
	.string "him seriously.$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo! CHAMP in making!\n"
	.string "Your really rocking.\p"
	.string "Are you battleing the GYM LEADERS\n"
	.string "of KANTO?\p"
	.string "They’re strong and dedicated\n"
	.string "people, just like JOHTO’s GYM\l"
	.string "LEADERS.$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "Yo! CHAMP in making!\n"
	.string "That GYM didn’t give you much\l"
	.string "trouble.\p"
	.string "The way you took charge was really\n"
	.string "inspiring.\p"
	.string "I mean that seriously.$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "PEWTER POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: BROCK\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:$"

PewterCity_Interior3_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "PEWTER POKéMON GYM\n"
